 **********************************************
 ********* Roland GP-16 Patch Chart ***********
 **********************************************
 
 Patch Name: Funky - Distorted
     Author: Thomas Edlund
   Comments: Sounds Crispy!
 
 PROGRAM CHANGE NO.  B: 13
 
 SEQUENCE BLOCK A	123456
 SEQUENCE BLOCK B	123456
 
 BLOCK A - ON/OFF       12**56
 BLOCK B - ON/OFF       ****5*
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-1 COMPRESSOR
 
    TONE 0
  ATTACK 70
 SUSTAIN 100
   LEVEL 70
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-2
 	b. OVERDRIVE
 
   TONE 0
  DRIVE 100
 TURBO: OFF
  LEVEL 70
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-5 PARAMETRIC EQ
 
    HI FREQ 2.00 kHz
   HI LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
   H.M.FREQ 1.70 kHz
     H.M. Q 1.0
 H.M. LEVEL +3.5 dB
 
  L.M. FREQ 1.00 kHz
     L.M. Q 1.0
 L.M. LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
    LO FREQ 250 Hz
   LO LEVEL 0.0 dB
 
  OUT LEVEL +3.5 dB
 
 ----------------------------------
 A-6 NOISE SUPPRESSOR
 
    SENS 25
 RELEASE 3
   LEVEL 100

 ----------------------------------
 B-5 REVERB
 
 DECAY 1.5 sec
 
 MODE: SPRING 1
 
    CUTOFF THRU
 PRE DELAY 0 msec
  E. LEVEL 50
 
 ----------------------------------
 MASTER VOLUME 90
 
 ----------------------------------
 EXPRESSION PEDAL
 
 ASSIGN OFF
 
 ----------------------------------
 OUTPUT SELECT
 
 CHANNEL 1

